# The build context is this directory. Everything below is either rebuilt inside the image,
# irrelevant to it, or must never enter it.

# Rebuilt in the image. Copying the host's would drag in darwin-arm64 platform binaries and
# pnpm's symlink farm, both of which break inside linux/arm64.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-build
**/.turbo
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# MUST NEVER ENTER AN IMAGE. Root CLAUDE.md: ".env files and data/ stay untracked"; an image
# layer is world-readable to anyone who can pull it, and layers survive deletion.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.secrets
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Unrebuildable evidence and the regression corpus — neither belongs in a deployment artefact.
data
../kite-momentum-rebalancer/data

# Test and tooling output.
coverage
coverage.json
playwright-report
test-results
benchmarks/*.json

# Version control and editor noise.
.git
.gitignore
.github
**/.DS_Store
**/*.log
